1
00:00:00,809 --> 00:00:02,729
(Bernadette:)Don't talk like that
on your wedding day.

2
00:00:02,937 --> 00:00:06,317
Sorry, Ma... Bernadette.
Ma... Bern... You're my Bernadette.

3
00:00:08,067 --> 00:00:11,357
- Good move telling Sheldon.
- Can't propose, can't talk to my friends.

4
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,740
(Leonard:)Is there anything else
I'm not allowed to do?

5
00:00:13,948 --> 00:00:16,578
(Amy:)All right, that's enough.
Today is not about you two.

6
00:00:17,576 --> 00:00:21,576
(Amy:)Today is about Howard
and Bernadette and me.

7
00:00:22,748 --> 00:00:24,708
Folks, can I have your attention?

8
00:00:24,917 --> 00:00:27,297
It's 5:00.
We're gonna take three more couples.

9
00:00:27,503 --> 00:00:29,543
The rest have to come back
on Monday.

10
00:00:29,838 --> 00:00:32,128
(Amy:)- No.
- I got this.

11
00:00:32,341 --> 00:00:35,881
(Howard:)Excuse me, but is there any way
you can squeeze us in?

12
00:00:36,095 --> 00:00:42,395
(Howard:)See, I'm an astronaut
and I'm leaving for Russia on Sunday...

13
00:00:42,601 --> 00:00:46,351
(Howard:)...so I can take a Soyuz rocket
to the lnternational Space Station.

14
00:00:46,564 --> 00:00:48,524
(Registrar:)Yeah, me too. I'll see you there.

15
00:00:50,985 --> 00:00:54,275
(Bernadette:)I can't believe
we're not gonna get married.

16
00:00:54,780 --> 00:01:06,030
I'm gonna go see if the couple at the
front of the line needs a maid of honor.

